        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Beast Within</i> is a cooperative horror escape game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent dispatched to a sealed research facility where CGI Corporation once conducted unethical experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone — the test subjects are still there, and they can hear even your breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place, sound determines life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to escape… if you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Sound Detection System:</strong> The monster reacts to both microphone input and in-game footsteps. Move quietly — or you’ll be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Co-op Escape Flow:</strong> Open doors, collect clues, and secure the escape route together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Stealth &amp; Distraction:</strong> Direct confrontation is impossible. Hide, distract, and move strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ <strong>Environmental Exploration:</strong> Experience the tension as you explore dark hallways filled with debris and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice and movement-based sound detection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse stealth, distraction, and escape strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense atmosphere with limited visibility and horror-focused design</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD – Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse – Look around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F – Interact</p>